@startuml
title SRM Failover Process

actor Admin
rectangle "Primary Site" {
  [vCenter Server]
  [VM Cluster A]
  database "Storage A"
}

rectangle "DR Site" {
  [vCenter Server DR]
  [VM Cluster B]
  database "Storage B (Replica)"
}

Admin --> [vCenter Server] : Trigger Failover
[vCenter Server] --> [vCenter Server DR] : SRM Replication
[VM Cluster A] --> [VM Cluster B] : VM Recovery
[Storage A] --> [Storage B (Replica)] : Data Sync

note bottom of [VM Cluster B]
  DR Site takes over workloads
  ensuring business continuity
end note

@enduml
